div&gt;i have come to realize many brides take so much to jamaica for there weddings. &amp;nbsp;if you dont want to take it all back consider donating to another future bride. &amp;nbsp;i will be in jamaica aug 16th week to prepare for my wedding. &amp;nbsp;email me at nardamartin@hotmail.com&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901697,"PostDate":1438483400,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>good everyone day<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>i have come to realize many brides take so much to jamaica for there weddings. \u00a0if you dont want to take it all back consider donating to another future bride. \u00a0i will be in jamaica aug 16th week to prepare for my wedding. \u00a0email me at nardamartin@hotmail.com<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dathotgal51@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.77.182.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423454325,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1440421860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"dathotgal","Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.239.65.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79453,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"282dc1d296624be9082521212715a413","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think that&#039;s a great idea.&amp;nbsp; I will be there Sept 29th preparing for my wedding and would love donations!!!...Enjoy and Congrats!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902065,"PostDate":1438932926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think that's a great idea.\u00a0 I will be there Sept 29th preparing for my wedding and would love donations!!!...Enjoy and Congrats!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soon2bmzbrooks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.82.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423494700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Soon2bmzbrooks","Id":282051,"Name":"Soon2bmzbrooks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.54.102.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79453,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79a81b16da483daad2f9d540eecb81e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;i love secrets, &amp;nbsp;the last time i was there a bride had so much left over and stuff they going to leave like fans and flip flops. &amp;nbsp;please as around and lets all recycle these items.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902088,"PostDate":1438947684,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i love secrets, \u00a0the last time i was there a bride had so much left over and stuff they going to leave like fans and flip flops. \u00a0please as around and lets all recycle these items.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dathotgal51@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.77.182.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423454325,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1440421860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"dathotgal","Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.199.70.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79453,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6eab5766fbe6e4aad037439a45dea6a0","RawContent":"Good idea to ask....we met a couple in Mexico who had a wedding the next month and we gave them a whole suitcase of stuff....I felt good about it plus we didn&#039;t have to pay $50 to fly the suitcase back with us to prob store indefinitely lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904283,"PostDate":1441648263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\