Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.211.99.179","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e74574fe204410c351deb05e8132334c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone heard of this resort or booked their wedding with this resort? I currentlly booked my wedding at this resort which is supposed to be built by November 1st, 2014. I&#039;m wondering if I should be nervous, I have not heard back from the coordinators as yet. They haven;t hired any staff and I am currently speaking with a wedding coordinator from Mexico who often tells me she isn&#039;t sure. Any thoughts?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861717,"PostDate":1406105060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone heard of this resort or booked their wedding with this resort? I currentlly booked my wedding at this resort which is supposed to be built by November 1st, 2014. I'm wondering if I should be nervous, I have not heard back from the coordinators as yet. They haven;t hired any staff and I am currently speaking with a wedding coordinator from Mexico who often tells me she isn't sure. Any thoughts?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tammy.jacobs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.211.99.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405939765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279107.jpg?_r=1408932832","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"projecttwayne2015","Id":279107,"Name":"projecttwayne2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be8aa04bca51c7e857a529f58ecd2ded","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am getting married there and I am nervous as well.&amp;nbsp; I am also talking with someone in mexico.&amp;nbsp; they havent even taken my deposit yet...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am very nervous!! Im am gettim married next june.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865174,"PostDate":1407483584,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting married there and I am nervous as well.\u00a0 I am also talking with someone in mexico.\u00a0 they havent even taken my deposit yet...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am very nervous!! Im am gettim married next june.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407482627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.29.94.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"977552e6481a6dbd5e60ca7fe3aa4b0d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am getting Married in Dreams Las Mareas April 16th 2015. They are very slow to get back to me but they are not yet at the hotel. I am planning to fly down there in Nov or Dec when they open to go over all the details for my wedding. They have not taken my deposit yet either but told me that my date is the only one available that week which is weird because I contacted them a year in advance. When did you guys book your dates?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865198,"PostDate":1407493125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting Married in Dreams Las Mareas April 16th 2015. They are very slow to get back to me but they are not yet at the hotel. I am planning to fly down there in Nov or Dec when they open to go over all the details for my wedding. They have not taken my deposit yet either but told me that my date is the only one available that week which is weird because I contacted them a year in advance. When did you guys book your dates?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lanaaksman@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.29.94.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407492928,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Laks86","Id":279365,"Name":"Laks86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ab9cdda35001bddf9cdb9fd73cb56b5","RawContent":"i think I booked in may but my wedding is Next June (rainy season)... April is Peak season because it doesnt rain as much....so it may be popular especially if its easter\/passover\/sprint break week.\n\nBut that doessound kinda weird that it was booked up that far in advance.   Make sure you take lots of pics of all the ceremony sites because there is so little information available... Im hoping there is something with a beach backdrop without actually walking in the sand... that would be perfect... or a beautiful gazebo with beach and mountains off to the side...lol\n\n\n[quote name=\"Laks86\" post=\"1865198\" timestamp=\"1407511125\"]\nI am getting Married in Dreams Las Mareas April 16th 2015. They are very slow to get back to me but they are not yet at the hotel. I am planning to fly down there in Nov or Dec when they open to go over all the details for my wedding. They have not taken my deposit yet either but told me that my date is the only one available that week which is weird because I contacted them a year in advance. When did you guys book your dates?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1865300,"PostDate":1407572656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i think I booked in may but my wedding is Next June (rainy season)... April is Peak season because it doesnt rain as much....so it may be popular especially if its easter\/passover\/sprint break week.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But that doessound kinda weird that it was booked up that far in advance.\u00a0\u00a0 Make sure you take lots of pics of all the ceremony sites because there is so little information available... Im hoping there is something with a beach backdrop without actually walking in the sand... that would be perfect... or a beautiful gazebo with beach and mountains off to the side...lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Laks86, on 08 August 2014 - 10:18 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am getting Married in Dreams Las Mareas April 16th 2015. They are very slow to get back to me but they are not yet at the hotel. I am planning to fly down there in Nov or Dec when they open to go over all the details for my wedding. They have not taken my deposit yet either but told me that my date is the only one available that week which is weird because I contacted them a year in advance. When did you guys book your dates?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407482627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.19.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1490ec86ece0cded37a82764868aff0d","RawContent":"The week I am getting married is actually right after all the holidays and the rates are dirt cheap. Whats your email? I can send you pics and info when I get back. I contacted the wedding coordinator about 5 times this week and of course no response so def need to go over there.","Attachments":[],"Id":1865302,"PostDate":1407574392,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The week I am getting married is actually right after all the holidays and the rates are dirt cheap. Whats your email? I can send you pics and info when I get back. I contacted the wedding coordinator about 5 times this week and of course no response so def need to go over there. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lanaaksman@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.29.94.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407492928,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Laks86","Id":279365,"Name":"Laks86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed51517564e632caacdfee0634dabcdf","RawContent":"Thanks so much... i Messaged you my email address...\n\nDo you have a photographer yet?  what other details have you added so far... I feel like i havent done anything but book the package... So far i have 42 people booked.... 18 rooms...  \n\nHow is your planning going so far?\n\n[quote name=\"Laks86\" post=\"1865302\" timestamp=\"1407592392\"]\nThe week I am getting married is actually right after all the holidays and the rates are dirt cheap. Whats your email? I can send you pics and info when I get back. I contacted the wedding coordinator about 5 times this week and of course no response so def need to go over there.[\/quote]\nHow is your planning going... i think it may just be the 3 of us for now...\n\n[quote name=\"projecttwayne2015\" post=\"1861717\" timestamp=\"1406123060\"]\nHi everyone,\n\nHas anyone heard of this resort or booked their wedding with this resort? I currentlly booked my wedding at this resort which is supposed to be built by November 1st, 2014. I&#039;m wondering if I should be nervous, I have not heard back from the coordinators as yet. They haven;t hired any staff and I am currently speaking with a wedding coordinator from Mexico who often tells me she isn&#039;t sure. Any thoughts?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1865370,"PostDate":1407603973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks so much... i Messaged you my email address...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Do you have a photographer yet?\u00a0 what other details have you added so far... I feel like i havent done anything but book the package... So far i have 42 people booked.... 18 rooms...\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How is your planning going so far?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Laks86, on 09 August 2014 - 08:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>The week I am getting married is actually right after all the holidays and the rates are dirt cheap. Whats your email? I can send you pics and info when I get back. I contacted the wedding coordinator about 5 times this week and of course no response so def need to go over there.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><br \/><p>How is your planning going... i think it may just be the 3 of us for now...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>projecttwayne2015, on 23 July 2014 - 08:44 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone heard of this resort or booked their wedding with this resort? I currentlly booked my wedding at this resort which is supposed to be built by November 1st, 2014. I'm wondering if I should be nervous, I have not heard back from the coordinators as yet. They haven;t hired any staff and I am currently speaking with a wedding coordinator from Mexico who often tells me she isn't sure. Any thoughts?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407482627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.148","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d20f9992a720c2a0cc98d9c07fa47911","RawContent":"[quote name=\"bkprettygirl\" post=\"1865174\" timestamp=\"1407501584\"]\nI am getting married there and I am nervous as well.  I am also talking with someone in mexico.  they havent even taken my deposit yet...\n \nI am very nervous!! Im am gettim married next june.\n[\/quote]when I sent in my forms back in May, they took my deposit 2, 3 days later.","Attachments":[],"Id":1865375,"PostDate":1407606338,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>bkprettygirl, on 08 August 2014 - 07:39 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I am getting married there and I am nervous as well.\u00a0 I am also talking with someone in mexico.\u00a0 they havent even taken my deposit yet...<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI am very nervous!! Im am gettim married next june.<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nwhen I sent in my forms back in May, they took my deposit 2, 3 days later.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tammy.jacobs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.211.99.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405939765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279107.jpg?_r=1408932832","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"projecttwayne2015","Id":279107,"Name":"projecttwayne2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef62d09865f7a7cc6502ea71dd05aff6","RawContent":"wow!! now I am VERY nervous!!!!!!!  He said they wouldnt be taking deposits until they hired someone on site...\n\noh my!!\n\nWhat else have you done so far? Photographer? etc...\n\n[quote name=\"projecttwayne2015\" post=\"1865375\" timestamp=\"1407624338\"]\nwhen I sent in my forms back in May, they took my deposit 2, 3 days later.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1865376,"PostDate":1407606468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>wow!! now I am VERY nervous!!!!!!!\u00a0 He said they wouldnt be taking deposits until they hired someone on site...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>oh my!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What else have you done so far? Photographer? etc...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>projecttwayne2015, on 09 August 2014 - 05:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>when I sent in my forms back in May, they took my deposit 2, 3 days later.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407482627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.148","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28e475781b2c7c78192ba13952723e50","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Laks86\" post=\"1865198\" timestamp=\"1407511125\"]\nI am getting Married in Dreams Las Mareas April 16th 2015. They are very slow to get back to me but they are not yet at the hotel. I am planning to fly down there in Nov or Dec when they open to go over all the details for my wedding. They have not taken my deposit yet either but told me that my date is the only one available that week which is weird because I contacted them a year in advance. When did you guys book your dates?[\/quote]I am getting married on April 18th and I booked this on May 12th, 2014. I spoke to Daniel and she booked it in for me. I am interested in going in December. Are you going alone?  \n[quote name=\"bkprettygirl\" post=\"1865370\" timestamp=\"1407621973\"]\nThanks so much... i Messaged you my email address...\n \nDo you have a photographer yet?  what other details have you added so far... I feel like i havent done anything but book the package... So far i have 42 people booked.... 18 rooms...  \n \nHow is your planning going so far?\n \n \nHow is your planning going... i think it may just be the 3 of us for now...[\/quote]ladies I just got some pricing for the photographer, centerpieces and such. I can email them to you. I have to say I wasn&#039;t expecting those prices. We have 82 people booked so it&#039;s going to be costly.","Attachments":[],"Id":1865377,"PostDate":1407607323,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Laks86, on 08 August 2014 - 10:18 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I am getting Married in Dreams Las Mareas April 16th 2015. They are very slow to get back to me but they are not yet at the hotel. I am planning to fly down there in Nov or Dec when they open to go over all the details for my wedding. They have not taken my deposit yet either but told me that my date is the only one available that week which is weird because I contacted them a year in advance. When did you guys book your dates?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI am getting married on April 18th and I booked this on May 12th, 2014. I spoke to Daniel and she booked it in for me. I am interested in going in December. Are you going alone?  <br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>bkprettygirl, on 09 August 2014 - 05:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thanks so much... i Messaged you my email address...<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nDo you have a photographer yet?\u00a0 what other details have you added so far... I feel like i havent done anything but book the package... So far i have 42 people booked.... 18 rooms...\u00a0\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHow is your planning going so far?<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHow is your planning going... i think it may just be the 3 of us for now...<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nladies I just got some pricing for the photographer, centerpieces and such. I can email them to you. I have to say I wasn't expecting those prices. We have 82 people booked so it's going to be costly.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tammy.jacobs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.211.99.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405939765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279107.jpg?_r=1408932832","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"projecttwayne2015","Id":279107,"Name":"projecttwayne2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8bf6869119118ce64b99c078b46c4bb","RawContent":"ok, i Messaged you my email.. please send it over... now im super nervous!!!!\n\nI wonder if they  updated the website also with the new info...\n\nim up to 42... but i think i might be close to your numbers when everything is said and done...\n\nyep... this is gonna be pricey!\n[quote name=\"projecttwayne2015\" post=\"1865377\" timestamp=\"1407625323\"]\nI am getting married on April 18th and I booked this on May 12th, 2014. I spoke to Daniel and she booked it in for me. I am interested in going in December. Are you going alone?\n\nladies I just got some pricing for the photographer, centerpieces and such. I can email them to you. I have to say I wasn&#039;t expecting those prices. We have 82 people booked so it&#039;s going to be costly.[\/quote]\nWhat time did you ladies book your ceremony for? I booked at 5 because they said sunset is at 5:30 I think?  lol I have no idea.. but I was thinking about 6pm as well.","Attachments":[],"Id":1865378,"PostDate":1407608899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>ok, i Messaged you my email.. please send it over... now im super nervous!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wonder if they\u00a0 updated the website also with the new info...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>im up to 42... but i think i might be close to your numbers when everything is said and done...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>yep... this is gonna be pricey!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>projecttwayne2015, on 09 August 2014 - 06:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am getting married on April 18th and I booked this on May 12th, 2014. I spoke to Daniel and she booked it in for me. I am interested in going in December. Are you going alone?<br><br>\nladies I just got some pricing for the photographer, centerpieces and such. I can email them to you. I have to say I wasn't expecting those prices. We have 82 people booked so it's going to be costly.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><br \/><p>What time did you ladies book your ceremony for? I booked at 5 because they said sunset is at 5:30 I think?\u00a0 lol I have no idea.. but I was thinking about 6pm as well.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407482627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":64,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
