{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5474e274e03a64b63e5f86b7def4523d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;So, I have gone back and forth on whether or not to post a \u201cplanning thread\u201d.&amp;nbsp; Everyone\u2019s seems so elaborate compared to what mine would be, but then I feel silly when fellow brides ask to see what I have planned so far and I have nothing.&amp;nbsp; So, I am going for it lol&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;How we met&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Yep, at a bar.   One of my friends and I had made plans to go and see this singer who was performing for his last time before moving out of town.&amp;nbsp; Little did I know that my friend had met Chris (my now fianc\u00e9e) previously and had also told him to come out for the night.&amp;nbsp; Chris had been sick and totally didn\u2019t feel up to going out but decided to anyways.&amp;nbsp; He walked in that night and I spotted him instantly.&amp;nbsp; I have always had a thing for guys in ball caps and I think that\u2019s what caught my attention.&amp;nbsp; Long story short, our friend ended up introducing us and we talked the whole night, to the point I started to lose my voice since I was trying to talk over all the music.&amp;nbsp; We grabbed a bite to eat afterwards and then said our goodbyes\u2026never thinking I would hear from him again.&amp;nbsp; But thanks to facebook, we connected and stayed in touch that way for a while.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Two weeks after we met that night, I was heading to Mexico (keep that in mind) with some girlfriends.&amp;nbsp; I was excited to go away, but bumming because I had just met this guy and now I wouldn\u2019t be able to see him for a week\u2026.the thought killed me.&amp;nbsp; But we made it work\u2026chatted NON-STOP through fb and made plans for me to stop by his house as soon as I got off the plane.&amp;nbsp; And that\u2019s how our relationship started.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Engagement&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Now back to Mexico again.&amp;nbsp; About a year and a half into our relationship, we decided to go to Mexico \u2013 to the resort I had gone to with my girlfriends.&amp;nbsp; One of the days that we were sitting out on the beach, a wedding was going on.&amp;nbsp; We looked at each other and just knew\u2026this is what we wanted for our wedding.&amp;nbsp; So, we talked about how we would just have it be the two of us and keep it nice and quiet.&amp;nbsp; But I also made it clear, I still wanted the \u201casking\u201d to be a surprise.&amp;nbsp; Couple months after coming home from our trip, we booked our wedding day for 10\/27\/15\u2026seemed so far away at this point.&amp;nbsp; 5 months after we set our date we were vacationing in St. Thomas.&amp;nbsp; We were on the beach, and I was so excited about these huge birds that were dive bombing the water to catch fish, that I didn\u2019t even realize he was attempting to ask me to marry him.&amp;nbsp; Once, I figured out what was going on\u2026I ended up crying and saying yes.&amp;nbsp; Even knowing that it was coming, I still ended up in tears with all of the romantic and sweet things he had to say.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Our Wedding:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;When starting to plan, we decided that there were others that we had to have there with us.&amp;nbsp; So we had planned on having about 15 of us.&amp;nbsp; Unfortunately, I lost my younger brother back in February and that changed a whole lot of things.&amp;nbsp; My Dad is not attending, as he says he doesn\u2019t have the money, we offered to pay but he refused to take it.&amp;nbsp; My mom is going and she will be walking me down the aisle now\u2026and honestly I couldn\u2019t be any more ok with this.&amp;nbsp; My mom and I were at my brother\u2019s side until he took his last breathe, and our relationship over these past 6 months has really grown.&amp;nbsp; Others are unable to come for other reasons also, so that leaves us with about 7 total.&amp;nbsp; Chris\u2019 brother also passed away about 4 years ago, so we decided to not do a bridal party since we don\u2019t have our best men to be there.&amp;nbsp; I made a frame to have at the table up front with their pictures and a little poem, we know they will be with us in spirit.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Our wedding is being held at 2pm on the beach followed by a cocktail hour with a Mirachi band.&amp;nbsp; I\u2019m still waiting on the hotel to give me more planning options so we can decide on the rest.&amp;nbsp; 7 weeks from today and I will be Mrs. Minich.&amp;nbsp; I couldn\u2019t be any happier about this.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;The Dress:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;I went to David\u2019s Bridal with a list of destination dresses I wanted to try, but there was this one that I wanted to try on last, because I liked it the most in pictures.&amp;nbsp; I didn\u2019t want to fall in love with the first dress without giving other dresses a try.&amp;nbsp; Needless to say, the last dress I tried on was my dress and fit me perfectly, minus needing a hem.&amp;nbsp; I knew I wanted to lose some weight I had gained from losing my brother, so this was now my goal.&amp;nbsp; Back in July, I went f or my first fitting (after losing almost 30lbs) and the dress needed a lot of work.&amp;nbsp; This Sunday I go back for my next fitting, I can\u2019t wait to get pictures of it now to compare it to what it looked like when I first bought it.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;To think I was worried about not having enough to say.&amp;nbsp; I am going to post pictures later when I get home, to go along with some of what I had posted.&amp;nbsp; But at least this is a start\u2026right?  &amp;nbsp; Have to say, you ladies have been so helpful with any questions I had\u2026you guys keep me sane! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Pics to come soon! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904322,"PostDate":1441713446,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">So, I have gone back and forth on whether or not to post a \u201cplanning thread\u201d.\u00a0 Everyone\u2019s seems so elaborate compared to what mine would be, but then I feel silly when fellow brides ask to see what I have planned so far and I have nothing.\u00a0 So, I am going for it lol<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><strong><u>How we met<\/u><\/strong>:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Yep, at a bar.\u00a0\u00a0 One of my friends and I had made plans to go and see this singer who was performing for his last time before moving out of town.\u00a0 Little did I know that my friend had met Chris (my now fianc\u00e9e) previously and had also told him to come out for the night.\u00a0 Chris had been sick and totally didn\u2019t feel up to going out but decided to anyways.\u00a0 He walked in that night and I spotted him instantly.\u00a0 I have always had a thing for guys in ball caps and I think that\u2019s what caught my attention.\u00a0 Long story short, our friend ended up introducing us and we talked the whole night, to the point I started to lose my voice since I was trying to talk over all the music.\u00a0 We grabbed a bite to eat afterwards and then said our goodbyes\u2026never thinking I would hear from him again.\u00a0 But thanks to facebook, we connected and stayed in touch that way for a while.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Two weeks after we met that night, I was heading to Mexico (keep that in mind) with some girlfriends.\u00a0 I was excited to go away, but bumming because I had just met this guy and now I wouldn\u2019t be able to see him for a week\u2026.the thought killed me.\u00a0 But we made it work\u2026chatted NON-STOP through fb and made plans for me to stop by his house as soon as I got off the plane.\u00a0 And that\u2019s how our relationship started.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><strong><u>Engagement<\/u><\/strong>:\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Now back to Mexico again.\u00a0 About a year and a half into our relationship, we decided to go to Mexico \u2013 to the resort I had gone to with my girlfriends.\u00a0 One of the days that we were sitting out on the beach, a wedding was going on.\u00a0 We looked at each other and just knew\u2026this is what we wanted for our wedding.\u00a0 So, we talked about how we would just have it be the two of us and keep it nice and quiet.\u00a0 But I also made it clear, I still wanted the \u201casking\u201d to be a surprise.\u00a0 Couple months after coming home from our trip, we booked our wedding day for 10\/27\/15\u2026seemed so far away at this point.\u00a0 5 months after we set our date we were vacationing in St. Thomas.\u00a0 We were on the beach, and I was so excited about these huge birds that were dive bombing the water to catch fish, that I didn\u2019t even realize he was attempting to ask me to marry him.\u00a0 Once, I figured out what was going on\u2026I ended up crying and saying yes.\u00a0 Even knowing that it was coming, I still ended up in tears with all of the romantic and sweet things he had to say.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Our Wedding:<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">When starting to plan, we decided that there were others that we had to have there with us.\u00a0 So we had planned on having about 15 of us.\u00a0 Unfortunately, I lost my younger brother back in February and that changed a whole lot of things.\u00a0 My Dad is not attending, as he says he doesn\u2019t have the money, we offered to pay but he refused to take it.\u00a0 My mom is going and she will be walking me down the aisle now\u2026and honestly I couldn\u2019t be any more ok with this.\u00a0 My mom and I were at my brother\u2019s side until he took his last breathe, and our relationship over these past 6 months has really grown.\u00a0 Others are unable to come for other reasons also, so that leaves us with about 7 total.\u00a0 Chris\u2019 brother also passed away about 4 years ago, so we decided to not do a bridal party since we don\u2019t have our best men to be there.\u00a0 I made a frame to have at the table up front with their pictures and a little poem, we know they will be with us in spirit.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Our wedding is being held at 2pm on the beach followed by a cocktail hour with a Mirachi band.\u00a0 I\u2019m still waiting on the hotel to give me more planning options so we can decide on the rest.\u00a0 7 weeks from today and I will be Mrs. Minich.\u00a0 I couldn\u2019t be any happier about this.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">The Dress:<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">I went to David\u2019s Bridal with a list of destination dresses I wanted to try, but there was this one that I wanted to try on last, because I liked it the most in pictures.\u00a0 I didn\u2019t want to fall in love with the first dress without giving other dresses a try.\u00a0 Needless to say, the last dress I tried on was my dress and fit me perfectly, minus needing a hem.\u00a0 I knew I wanted to lose some weight I had gained from losing my brother, so this was now my goal.\u00a0 Back in July, I went f or my first fitting (after losing almost 30lbs) and the dress needed a lot of work.\u00a0 This Sunday I go back for my next fitting, I can\u2019t wait to get pictures of it now to compare it to what it looked like when I first bought it.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">To think I was worried about not having enough to say.\u00a0 I am going to post pictures later when I get home, to go along with some of what I had posted.\u00a0 But at least this is a start\u2026right?\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Have to say, you ladies have been so helpful with any questions I had\u2026you guys keep me sane! <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Pics to come soon! <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411105603,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.200.253.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa1b69c8f69d3eb0968eb4b39ba3be18","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Fun story!!&amp;nbsp; Congrats!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So sorry for the loss of your brother!&amp;nbsp; I lost one of&amp;nbsp;my best friends 2 weeks after getting engaged so I know how it is wedding planning without someone important in your life **hugs**&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What hotel are you getting married at?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904340,"PostDate":1441724366,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Fun story!!\u00a0 Congrats!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So sorry for the loss of your brother!\u00a0 I lost one of\u00a0my best friends 2 weeks after getting engaged so I know how it is wedding planning without someone important in your life **hugs**<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What hotel are you getting married at?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Daisy<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to marry my best friend \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797<\/a>","Email":"daisy.pitre@gmail.com","IpAddress":"142.255.87.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414943123,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Janjin","Id":280967,"Name":"Janjin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.59.172.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e788502125ef4aad3afe12bca1f6317","RawContent":"@[member=\"Janjin\"] we are getting married at apt he Catalonia Riviera Maya.  \n\n\nSorry to hear of your loss also!\nOur theme is starfish as you will see in the next pics.  Our cake topper is fun and personalized for us.  My bouquet and the the corsages are real touch roses.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\nI was going to wait to post my dress pictures....but here it is before I lost the 30 lbs.  I&#039;ll post again after my next fitting on Sunday \ud83d\ude00\n\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1904345,"PostDate":1441728141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280967\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280967-janjin\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Janjin<\/span><\/a> we are getting married at apt he Catalonia Riviera Maya.  <br><br>\nSorry to hear of your loss also!<br \/>Our theme is starfish as you will see in the next pics.  Our cake topper is fun and personalized for us.  My bouquet and the the corsages are real touch roses.  <br><br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1904345]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-43959900-1441745928.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  145.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-43959900-1441745928.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1904345]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-51030500-1441745950.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  54.02KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-51030500-1441745950.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1904345]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-42394200-1441745972.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  60.05KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-42394200-1441745972.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1904345]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-55965500-1441745984.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  58.7KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-55965500-1441745984.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nI was going to wait to post my dress pictures....but here it is before I lost the 30 lbs.  I'll post again after my next fitting on Sunday \ud83d\ude00<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1904345]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-35012100-1441746000.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  63.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-35012100-1441746000.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1904345]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-11604100-1441746107.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  118.3KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-11604100-1441746107.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411105603,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ffd8f3fba2a2c1bd1ea6ec5f7c7061d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The dress looks gorgeous on you! &amp;nbsp;30 lbs is awesome, can&#039;t wait to see the &#039;after&#039; of you in your dress too :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Everything looks great, real touch flowers always impress me!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I too am so sorry to hear about your brother, hugs....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Looking forward to more!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904355,"PostDate":1441743360,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The dress looks gorgeous on you! \u00a030 lbs is awesome, can't wait to see the 'after' of you in your dress too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Everything looks great, real touch flowers always impress me!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I too am so sorry to hear about your brother, hugs....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looking forward to more!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.52.133.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"552ec3e866c781f56a95f8551a20050e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Beautiful. I love the dress on you and congrats on losing 30lbs - that&#039;s amazing :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904357,"PostDate":1441743860,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Beautiful. I love the dress on you and congrats on losing 30lbs - that's amazing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10c4a77fbf2a798c405e3cd6e05aee48","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow, 30 lbs congratulations that is a huge accomplishment! Your dress looks beautiful on you and I can&#039;t wait to see it altered.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And I&#039;m sorry about your brother.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904359,"PostDate":1441744134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow, 30 lbs congratulations that is a huge accomplishment! Your dress looks beautiful on you and I can't wait to see it altered.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And I'm sorry about your brother.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410080585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"194282acc0ce9012245bbc9489f32730","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks ladies!&amp;nbsp; The seamstress was not too pleased with the weight loss.&amp;nbsp; They actually wanted to put me in a smaller size dress but that changed how far the back dropped down, which is one of the things I loved about the dress.&amp;nbsp; I will definitely post pics on Sunday so you (and I) can see the difference.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904393,"PostDate":1441775244,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks ladies!\u00a0 The seamstress was not too pleased with the weight loss.\u00a0 They actually wanted to put me in a smaller size dress but that changed how far the back dropped down, which is one of the things I loved about the dress.\u00a0 I will definitely post pics on Sunday so you (and I) can see the difference.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411105603,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
